    "まだ開いていない": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Locked"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "音だけの、神経衰弱": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Memory, played by ear"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "カードには絵がありません。めくると音が鳴ります。同じ音を耳だけで見つけて、2 枚そろえます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The cards have no pictures. Each one plays a sound when you turn it. Find the matching sound by ear and pair them up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "遊ぶうちに、音の高さを聞き分ける耳が育ちます": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As you play, your ear for pitch gets sharper"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ音 → オクターブ → 和音 → 音程の順に進みます": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Same note → octaves → chords → intervals"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "イヤホンなしでも遊べます。音量は小さめから": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No headphones needed. It starts quiet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "4 枚の盤で試す": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Try a 4-card board"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "耳を、もっと先まで": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Take your ear further"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "みみ合わせ Pro は 1 回だけの買い切りです。サブスクではありません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ear Pairs Pro is a one-time purchase. No subscription."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "和音と音程の 24 段階": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "24 chord and interval levels"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "長・短・sus4・減・増・長七、転回まで。音程は短2度からオクターブまで。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Major, minor, sus4, dim, aug, maj7 and inversions. Intervals from a minor 2nd to an octave."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取り違えた音だけで、何度でも 6 組の盤を作ります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Builds 6-pair boards from just the sounds you mix up, as often as you like."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "音色 オルゴール・マリンバ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Music box and marimba sounds"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ音でも、音色が変わると聞き分けの練習になります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hearing the same note in a new timbre is great ear practice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "26 週の記録": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "26 weeks of history"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "半年ぶんの遊んだ日を、1 枚のマスで。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Half a year of play on one grid."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今日の盤・同じ音とオクターブの 30 段階・和音と音程の 3 段階ずつ・記録は、ずっと無料です。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today's board, all 30 same-note and octave levels, the first 3 chord and interval levels, and your log stay free forever."
          }
        }
      }
    },
